@startuml FIG-CL-TAV-01
skinparam shadowing false
title FIG-CL-TAV-01 Context\nSysML 1.6 notation-based views; executable/metamodel conformance is not claimed\nsubset of context relations; satisfy/verify are model relations, not executed verification

actor Operator
node TestAdapter
node IUT
node NetworkClock
cloud Integrity645 as "645 integrity boundary\nidentity bound; capability NOT-ESTABLISHED"

Operator --> TestAdapter : test request
TestAdapter --> IUT : stimulus
IUT --> TestAdapter : observation Izk
TestAdapter --> NetworkClock : time / error bound
IUT ..> Integrity645 : call and state only\nnot algorithm evidence
TestAdapter --> Msess : observation port to verification session
note bottom of IUT
  Protocol messages and operation states
  belong to Mprot, not to Msess.
end note
@enduml
